<title>UK: LME copper barely changed in sluggish pre-market.</title>
<headline>LME copper barely changed in sluggish pre-market.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Quiet, market barely softer after stocks fall 2,100 tonnes. Cash/threes little changed at $78/$83 backwardation.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Touch weaker after stocks decline by 2,250 tonnes.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Marginally firmer.</p>
<p>ZINC - Slips under $1,340.</p>
<p>LEAD/TIN - Barely lower.</p>
</text>
